                    # Check if swapping this component frees color c for v
                    # After swap, v would get color c (since it was target_color)
                    # We need to ensure no neighbor of v has color c after swap
                    # Neighbors of v that are in the component and colored c will become target_color
                    # Neighbors of v that are in the component and colored target_color will become c -> conflict!
                    # Actually, we need to check: after swap, any neighbor of v that was colored c becomes target_color (safe)
                    # and any neighbor of v that was colored target_color becomes c (conflict if exists)
