                    # But swapping only changes colors within the component, so we need to check:
                    # For any neighbor u of v:
                    #   If u in comp: its color flips, so if it was c -> target_color, or target_color -> c
                    #   If u not in comp: color unchanged
                    # We want that after swap, no neighbor of v has color c.
                    # Currently, neighbors of v may have color c or target_color.
                    # After swap:
                    #   - If neighbor u in comp and had color c -> becomes target_color
                    #   - If neighbor u in comp and had target_color -> becomes c
