                        # Actually, swapping is always safe for the whole component.
                        # But we want to know if after swap, v can be c (it will be) and we don't care about others as long as valid.
                        # The goal is to make v not target_color, so we can reduce the color class.
                        # So we can always swap and v will become c.
                        # But we might pull other vertices into target_color? 
                        # Actually, vertices in component that were c become target_color, and vice versa.
